---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Margdarshak Shikshan Sansthan"
  description="Privacy policy for Margdarshak Shikshan Sansthan, including how we handle enquiry information from website, ads, WhatsApp, Messenger, and other channels."
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-slate-50 py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top,_rgba(229,57,53,0.12),_transparent_35%),radial-gradient(circle_at_bottom_right,_rgba(255,179,0,0.12),_transparent_30%)]"></div>

    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 md:px-6">
      <div class="mb-10 text-center">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-secondary/20 bg-secondary/5 px-4 py-2 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-secondary">
          Legal Information
        </span>
        <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-primary md:text-6xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-600 md:text-lg">Effective date: 18 September 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_15px_40px_rgba(7,20,38,0.04)] md:p-10">
        <div class="space-y-8 text-slate-700">
          <div>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              This Privacy Policy explains how Margdarshak Shikshan Sansthan (“we,” “us,” or “our”) collects, uses,
              and protects your personal information when you contact us through our website, Meta/Facebook or Instagram
              advertisements, instant forms, WhatsApp, Messenger, or other communication channels.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-primary">Information We Collect</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">We may collect the following information:</p>
            <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-relaxed">
              <li>Full name.</li>
              <li>Mobile or WhatsApp phone number.</li>
              <li>Course preferences and enquiry details.</li>
              <li>Messages and information you voluntarily provide.</li>
              <li>Basic information related to the advertisement or form through which you contacted us.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-primary">How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">We use your information to:</p>
            <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-relaxed">
              <li>Respond to your course enquiry.</li>
              <li>Contact you regarding DCA, ADCA, Coding, Artificial Intelligence, Digital Marketing, and related educational programs.</li>
              <li>Provide counselling, admission information, schedules, fees, and course updates.</li>
              <li>Send relevant communication through phone calls, SMS, WhatsApp, Messenger, or other permitted channels.</li>
              <li>Improve our courses, services, advertisements, and learner communication.</li>
              <li>Maintain records of enquiries and admissions.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">We do not sell or rent your personal information to third parties.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-primary">Sharing of Information</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              We may share necessary information with trusted service providers that help us manage enquiries,
              communication, advertising, website hosting, analytics, CRM systems, or educational services. These
              providers may process information only for providing services to us.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
              Your information may also be processed by Meta, WhatsApp, Messenger, Google, or other platforms when you
              use their services. Their processing is governed by their respective privacy policies and terms.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-primary">Data Security</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              We take reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect your personal information from
              unauthorised access, misuse, loss, alteration, or disclosure. However, no online transmission or storage
              system can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-primary">Data Retention</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              We retain your information only for as long as reasonably necessary to respond to your enquiry, provide
              educational services, maintain business records, comply with legal requirements, or resolve disputes.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-primary">Your Choices and Rights</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">You may contact us to:</p>
            <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-relaxed">
              <li>Ask what personal information we hold about you.</li>
              <li>Request correction of inaccurate information.</li>
              <li>Request deletion of your information, where legally permitted.</li>
              <li>Withdraw your consent to receive marketing or promotional communication.</li>
              <li>Ask us to stop contacting you.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
              To make a request, contact us using the details below.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-primary">Cookies and Tracking</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              Our website or advertising platforms may use cookies, pixels, analytics, or similar technologies to measure
              advertising performance, understand visitor behaviour, and improve our services. You may manage cookies
              through your browser settings.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-primary">Children’s Information</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              Our services are intended to be used with the involvement of parents or guardians where required. We do not
              knowingly collect personal information from children without appropriate consent.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-primary">Policy Updates</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The updated version will be published on this page
              with a revised effective date.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-primary">Contact Us</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">If you have any questions, requests, or concerns about this Privacy Policy, contact us:</p>
            <div class="mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              <p><strong>Business name:</strong> Margdarshak Shikshan Sansthan</p>
              <p><strong>Website:</strong> https://margdarshakss.com</p>
              <p><strong>Email:</strong> margdarshakss@gmail.com</p>
              <p><strong>Phone/WhatsApp:</strong> 9113791935</p>
              <p><strong>Address:</strong> Near New Variety Readymade, Benta Chowk, Darbhanga, Bihar, India</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
